{"id":844623,"title":"22｜搭建微信小程序开发环境","content":"本节课介绍了如何注册微信小程序账号并下载开发工具。首先，访问微信公众平台网站，选择小程序类型进行注册。注册时需提供未被微信公众平台或开放平台使用过的邮箱地址，并设置管理员信息。完成注册后，通过邮箱激活账号并选择个人或企业类型。企业类型需支付300元年费，并上传营业执照和法人身份证等资料。认证成功后，填写小程序名称、简介及头像，选择服务类目。对于电商程序，需选择相应类目并提交相关资质。接着，下载微信开发者工具，安装完成后配置环境变量。打开开发者工具，登录账号，导入现有项目或新建项目。在项目中，可以预览界面并选择调试机型。最后，课程为后续实战阶段做准备，将指导学员开发电商小程序。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":397741,"user_name":"gesanri","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1121174,"ip_address":"湖北","ucode":"AE3B97DC3ED668","user_header":"http://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaELtOO0HKrj5SI5JSlmwiaCvaF6GLiaTmf5NX88OZaO3HymTAGTeIoicBUjqzmMF6sF5raPFjuqLFibrrw/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1739455478,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":144316,"content":"不影响后续学习的哈","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1224950,"ctime":1739516618,"ip_address":"河北","comment_id":397741,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100855101,"comment_content":"那我为了支付功能还要注册一个公司？不要这个功能也不影响后面的学习吧","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1224950,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/b0/f6/eb6a8f61.jpg","nickname":"郭旭","note":"","ucode":"7CC6787BD0F0A9","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":657197,"discussion_content":"不影响后续学习的哈","content_length":9,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1739516619,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"河北","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]}]}